  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 — Targets .NET 10 (net8.0 dropped: this is the breaking change behind\n      the major bump). Appending into a large existing file now works: a table's\n      usage map slides its inline window to follow the table and is promoted to a\n      reference-style map once the table outgrows one bitmap, so inserts no longer\n      fail past ~2 MB — and a refusal no longer strands an allocated page. See\n      CHANGELOG.md.",
